  "description": "POVBAG crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H80 Dy6 N28 O42,8(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.820-3.834 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.56-111.90°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6L3(NO3)6(DMF)4(H2O)2]·8DMF. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
